{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/958030-need-help-designing-silver-pack-challenges","id":958030,"title":"Need help designing Silver Pack challenges","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-25T20:34:59-07:00","id":958030,"title":"Need help designing Silver Pack challenges","content":"So I'm running a campaign where the PCs are high level Garou hoping to earn a spot in the Silver Pack. They just competed in the Glory challenges, and now they face the trials of Wisdom.<br /> <br /> What I need are ideas for these trials/challenges. What are some good Wisdom challenges? I was thinking some sort of labyrinth and riddles, but I'd like a little more. The Sept where the trials are taking place is a high level Shadow Lord caern, if that helps any.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12050-ursedrah-tahru","name":"Ursedrah-Tahru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12050_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T10:33:54-07:00","id":967397,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn difficult very difficult<br /> <br /> Wisdom can be a tricky thing to test.<br /> <br /> Riddles are one way... another is having to complete some kind of umbral quest... or maybe with shadow lords, look at some example of Stagnation and how its damaging the garou nation.<br /> <br /> glory and honor can be difficult to discern did the &quot;Garou nation&quot; LARP at the grand masquerade and used my silver fang galliard as bait to lead the Dancers away from my pack, and wondered, is that Glory or honor that he's due.<br /> <br /> while running off and playing infantile games may not seem very Glorious, it kept rest of the pack alive, and luckily the galliard survived.<br /> <br /> Or is it more an honor thing as he did the only thing he could to protect the pack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}